<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστᾰτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for a</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστάτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.1
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ π. ῥίζης ἐκβλαστάνει
				[τύραννος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				565d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>magnificent</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς τιμῆς σεμνὸν
				καὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.33.9
			</span></i>, al. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, σεμνῶς καὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.88.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ready to champion</i> or <i>protect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ βοηθητικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό</span>,
			name of a charge included in a lease, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				590
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
